keys ALWAYS
- quit ctrl+q
- NEW_CHAT ctrl+n
- refresh ctrl+r

panels
- ACTIONS border single
- MODELS border single
- PS border single
- CHAT border rounded
- SERVER border single fg grey
- ASK_LINE border rounded
- MENU.selected fg black bg cyan
- KEYS fg black bg cyan

logs
- CHAT.stderr fg red
- SERVER.stderr fg grey
